### Tests des Certifications - Sensibilisation Cybersécurité
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000

### Variables globales
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Créer une certification de sensibilisation basique
POST {{baseUrl}}/learning/certifications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{superadmin_token}}

{
  "utilisateur": 1,
  "parcours": 1,
  "type_certification": "sensibilisation_basique",
  "url_certification": "https://example.com/certifications/sensibilisation-basique-user1.pdf"
}

###

### 2. Créer une certification anti-phishing
POST {{baseUrl}}/learning/certifications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{superadmin_token}}

{
  "utilisateur": 1,
  "parcours": 4,
  "type_certification": "specialiste_anti_phishing",
  "url_certification": "https://example.com/certifications/anti-phishing-user1.pdf"
}

